---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { housesAlphabetical } from '../data/houses';
---
<Layout
  title="Surfer Element — Three surf houses in Tamraght, one booking"
  description="Compare three independent surf houses in Tamraght, Morocco by real guest reviews, book with a price that's locked in, and pay in your own language."
  navLabel="Home"
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <div>
      <h1>Three surf houses in Tamraght. One way to book.</h1>
      <p class="prose" style="font-size: var(--text-lead)">
        Surfer Element is a booking service for three independent surf houses in
        Tamraght, Morocco: SurfsHUB Tamraght, Cactus Surf &amp; Skate House and
        Hakuna Matata Guest House. We help you find the one that fits you, and
        book it in your own language, with a price that's locked in once you
        see it.
      </p>
      <div class="triptych" style="margin-block: var(--space-6)">
        {housesAlphabetical.map((h) => (
          <div class="photo-placeholder">Photos from {h.name} coming soon</div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-panel">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Where are you starting from?</h2>
      <p>Start the fit check. Four short questions, no sign-up, and we'll show
        you which house fits what you're looking for, with the reasons tied
        to your answers.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/fit-check/" style="width:100%">Start the fit check</a>
      <p style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:0"><a class="btn-quiet" href="/compare/">Or see all three houses side by side</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--surface">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Tell us what you're looking for, or compare all three yourself.</strong>
          The fit check takes about a minute. Prefer to look yourself? The
          <a href="/compare/">comparison page</a> has everything side by side:
          real guest-review scores, what guests keep mentioning, and who each
          house does and doesn't suit.</li>
        <li><strong>Book with a price that's locked in.</strong> Once you see
          your price, it doesn't rise, even if the house's own direct price
          does later. <a href="/price-lock/">How the price lock works &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><strong>Pay a 15% deposit now, the rest at the house.</strong> You
          pay the deposit on this site when you book; the balance is paid
          directly to the house when you arrive, the same way it's always
          been done in Tamraght. Meals, coaching, yoga and your airport
          transfer both ways are already included in the price.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>The three houses</h2>
      <p class="compare-note">Listed alphabetically.</p>
      <div class="house-grid">
        {housesAlphabetical.map((h) => (
          <article class="house-card">
            <div class="house-card__photo"><div class="photo-placeholder">Photos from {h.name} coming soon</div></div>
            <div class="house-card__name">
              <span class="house-dot" style={`background: var(${h.accentVar})`}></span>
              <h3>{h.name}</h3>
            </div>
            <p>{h.theme.slice(0, 140)}&hellip;</p>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={`/houses/${h.slug}/`}>See {h.name} &rarr;</a>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--surface">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What guests actually say</h2>
      <p>We don't write our own description of what each house is like. We
        read what real guests wrote on Booking.com and summarize it honestly,
        good and less-good. Every score and every theme on this site is dated
        and links back to the source. <a href="/compare/">See the full comparison &rarr;</a></p>

      <h2>A booking service, not a directory</h2>
      <p>Surfer Element works with these three houses and represents only
        them. We don't list every surf camp in Tamraght, and we're paid by
        the houses you book through us. We'd rather say that plainly than
        bury it in fine print. <a href="/about/">More about how this works &rarr;</a></p>

      <h2>Questions before you book?</h2>
      <p>The <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a> covers deposits, cancellations, getting
        from Agadir airport to Tamraght, and what's included. Can't find it
        there? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
